# Under the input contract (PLAN.md) a signed comparison of operands
# of unknown range is read in the integers: n + %tid.x < n + 32 is
# %tid.x < 32, so the store runs on the 32 threads below 32, in 1 warp,
# and the CTA stores 128 B. So is an unsigned one, a parameter n taken
# as nonnegative.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/setp_unknown_range.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_signed( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // warp 0 × lane * | exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_unsigned( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // warp 0 × lane * | exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
# The third kernel sums in .u32 and compares .s32, read as %tid.x < 32
# under the input contract (PLAN.md), which excludes n = 0x7fffffe0:
# 32 threads in 1 warp, the CTA's 128 B. Wrong output (PLAN.md): the
# fourth compares n with n & 0x7fffffff, read as false where a negative
# n makes it true: the store runs on no thread, and the kernel sums to
# no bytes.
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_mixed( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // warp 0 × lane * | exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_mask( // block 64×1×1{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // no thread | exec 0/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 0 (ideal 0){{$}}
# The fifth swaps the second's operands, `hi`, and runs on the same
# threads.
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_hi( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // warp 0 × lane * | exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
